# Empty range keeps the pre-loop element type

Verifies a loop that executes zero times leaves the element flow state at its
entry value, so the write inside the body is never reachable and `a[0]` still
adds as `10mm + 1mm = 11mm`.

>>> source
let a: int[] = [10mm]

for (i in 0..0) {
    a[0] = 2cm
}

print(a[0] + 1mm)

<<< stdout
11mm

<<< stderr
